CIFAR RevNet-38: 464890 learned / 2672 moving scalars, 9 units, 3 stored stage entries.
CIFAR RevNet-110: 1729194 learned / 8256 moving scalars, 27 units, 3 stored stage entries.
CIFAR RevNet-164: 1748778 learned / 24768 moving scalars, 27 units, 3 stored stage entries.
ImageNet RevNet-56: 27553128 learned / 51200 moving scalars, 9 units, 4 stored stage entries.
ImageNet RevNet-104: 45428072 learned / 100352 moving scalars, 17 units, 4 stored stage entries.
RevNet-38: 113 parameter derivatives; stored-input relative error 0.000000000; reconstructed-input relative error 0.000001338; max reconstruction relative drift 0.000000448.
